    "review": {
      "summary": "Adds a token-bucket limiter to the telemetry ingest route, keyed per fleet, with a config knob for the window and burst and a bypass for internal collectors. The limiter is a small self-contained class; the route change is a middleware insertion. Tests cover refill and burst but not the bypass path.",
      "verdict": "comment",
      "scores": {
        "quality": 88,
        "correctness_risk": 25,
        "test_coverage": 75,
        "readability": 92,
        "pr_hygiene": 84
      },
      "findings": [
        {
          "file": "src/ingest/limiter.ts",
          "severity": "high",
          "title": "Limiter key falls back to client IP",
          "detail": "When fleetId is missing the key is the socket address, so every fleet behind one NAT shares a single bucket. Reject requests without a fleetId instead of falling back."
        },
        {
          "file": "src/ingest/routes.ts",
          "severity": "medium",
          "title": "Bypass header is trusted from any origin",
          "detail": "x-internal-collector is honoured without checking the source network. Gate it on the internal CIDR list already in config."
        },
        {
          "file": "src/config.ts",
          "severity": "low",
          "title": "Magic window of 1200 ms",
          "detail": "Name the default next to INGEST_BURST so both knobs are tuned together."
        },
        {
          "file": "test/ingest/limiter.test.ts",
          "severity": "nit",
          "title": "Fake timers left installed",
          "detail": "vi.useFakeTimers() is never restored; add afterEach(vi.useRealTimers)."
        }
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        {
          "file": "src/ingest/limiter.ts",
          "change": "New TokenBucket class with refill(), take() and a per-key map with idle eviction."
        },
        {
          "file": "src/ingest/routes.ts",
          "change": "Inserts the limiter middleware before the ingest handler; 429 with Retry-After on exhaustion."
        },
        {
          "file": "src/config.ts",
          "change": "Adds INGEST_WINDOW_MS and INGEST_BURST with defaults."
        },
        {
          "file": "test/ingest/limiter.test.ts",
          "change": "Covers refill timing and burst capacity with fake timers."
        },
        {
          "file": "docs/ingest.md",
          "change": "Documents the two new environment variables."
        }
      ]
    },
